[I] Library for encoding decoding data use base32 or base64

[T] libbaseencode is a library written in C for encoding and decoding data
[T] using base32 or base64 according to RFC 4648. It is used by libcotp for
[T] one-time password generation.

[U] https://github.com/paolostivanin/libbaseencode

